          "evidence_ids": ["wn31:n:08131836", "wn31:n:05876035"],
          "uncertainty": "证据中‘finance section of the company’和‘specialized division of a large organization’均支持此义，基本匹配。"
        }
      ],
      "proposed_core": [
        "名词：部分（整体中的一个部分，可指物体或抽象划分）",
